# Feast imports EVERY .py file it finds in this directory as a
# feature-definition module. Only features.py actually defines Feast
# objects; the other scripts are a data-preparation helper and online /
# offline retrieval consumers, so they must be excluded here or their
# module-level code would execute on every `feast apply`.
prepare_feature_source.py
get_online_features.py
get_historical_features.py
reuse_features_for_clustering.py
test_workflow.py
